 "final_prompt": "Can you make me a shopping list for tonight's dinner, lemon garlic chicken with potatoes? Skip anything I already have, which is salt, olive oil, and oregano. The list should cover chicken, lemons, garlic, and potatoes, one per line, exactly four lines, with no instructions.\n\n<document>\nWeeknight lemon chicken (serves 4)\n\nIngredients\n4 chicken thighs\n2 lemons\n3 cloves garlic\n1 tbsp olive oil\n1 tsp dried oregano\n1 lb baby potatoes\nsalt\n\nSteps\n1. Preheat the oven to 425°F.\n2. Toss the potatoes with the olive oil and salt.\n3. Rub the chicken with garlic, oregano and lemon zest.\n4. Roast everything for 35 minutes, squeeze the lemons over the top, and serve.\n</document>",
